---
import Logo from "../../logos/Logo.astro";
// Illustrative: a coding agent delegating reviews to two other agents. Commands
// and XML fragments mirror the real `devspace agents` output; ids and findings
// are made up. Long results are truncated, as they would be in a terminal.
---

<div class="mock" role="img" aria-label="Illustration: Claude Code delegating reviews to Codex and Pi with devspace agents, then reading their findings">
  <div class="mock__bar">
    <span class="mock__dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>
    <span class="mock__title"><Logo id="claude" size={14} /> Claude Code · <b>~/work/billing</b></span>
    <span class="mock__pill">devspace skill</span>
  </div>

  <div class="mock__body sh">
    <p class="r" style="--d:.2s"><span class="dim">›</span> get Codex and Pi to review this before I merge</p>
    <p class="r" style="--d:.8s"><span class="prompt">$</span> devspace agents run codex "Review the staged diff for correctness…"</p>
    <p class="r xml" style="--d:1.2s">&lt;agent id="agt_7Kq2" status="running"/&gt;</p>
    <p class="r" style="--d:1.8s"><span class="prompt">$</span> devspace agents run pi "Check the staged diff for test gaps…"</p>
    <p class="r xml" style="--d:2.2s">&lt;agent id="agt_Q9m4" status="running"/&gt;</p>
    <p class="r" style="--d:2.8s"><span class="prompt">$</span> devspace agents wait agt_7Kq2 agt_Q9m4</p>

    <div class="results">
      <article class="result r" style="--d:4s">
        <header><Logo id="openai" size={15} /><b>codex</b><span class="dim">gpt-6-astra · xhigh</span><span class="done">✓ completed</span></header>
        <pre><span class="xml">&lt;agent id="agt_7Kq2" status="completed"&gt;</span>
<b>3 findings</b>
1. export.ts:48  quotes in cell values aren't
   escaped; breaks on names like O"Brien
2. export.ts:71  UTF-8 BOM missing, Excel
   misreads accented characters
3. csv.ts:22  numeric strings lose leading
   zeros (invoice ids)
<span class="more">… +6 more lines</span></pre>
      </article>

      <article class="result r" style="--d:4.8s">
        <header><Logo id="pi" size={15} /><b>pi</b><span class="dim">fable-5.1 · high</span><span class="done">✓ completed</span></header>
        <pre><span class="xml">&lt;agent id="agt_Q9m4" status="completed"&gt;</span>
<b>4 test gaps</b>
- empty invoice list: no test for a
  header-only export
- 10k+ rows: streaming path is untested
- JPY totals: currency formatting has no
  zero-decimal case
<span class="more">… +4 more lines</span></pre>
      </article>
    </div>

    <p class="r final" style="--d:5.8s"><span class="dim">›</span> Both reviews are in. Fixing export.ts:48 first, then adding the empty-list and JPY tests.<i class="caret"></i></p>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .sh { padding: 20px 22px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1px; }
  .sh p { margin: 0; word-break: break-word; }
  .prompt { color: #c9f26a; }
  .final { margin-top: 14px !important; color: #ececf0; }
  .caret { display: inline-block; width: 8px; height: 15px; background: #c9f26a; vertical-align: -2px; margin-left: 3px; animation: mock-blink 0.8s infinite alternate; }

  .results { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 12px; margin-top: 12px; }
  .result { border: 1px solid var(--m-line); border-radius: 8px; background: var(--m-panel); overflow: hidden; min-width: 0; }
  .result header { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 8px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--m-line); font-size: 12px; }
  .result header b { font-weight: 500; }
  .result .done { margin-left: auto; color: #4ade80; }
  .result pre { margin: 0; padding: 11px 12px 12px; font: 12.5px/1.6 "IBM Plex Mono", monospace; color: #d3d0c8; white-space: pre-wrap; word-break: break-word; }
  .result pre b { color: #f4f2ec; font-weight: 500; }
  .more { color: var(--m-dim); font-style: italic; }

  @media (max-width: 820px) { .results { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
